  "RATIONALE": [
    "Authoritative dependence-preserving planning (whole exposed years + one contiguous partial block, re-centred to the assumed effect) keeps the observed year-level heterogeneity: exposed yearly means -0.0691, -0.0677, -0.0307, +0.0315, +0.0363 (between-year sd about 0.049, 2.5x the discovery effect).",
    "At the full discovery effect, statistical+direction power is 0.60 for 2025 only, 0.52 for 2025 plus the available 2026 prefix and 0.69 for full 2025-2026; all below 0.80. The full-pass upper bound is 0.60 / 0.48 / 0.37.",
    "Statistical+direction power first reaches 0.80 at about 468 fresh weeks (9 years) at the full discovery effect; the full-pass upper bound stays below 0.80 up to 780 weeks (15 years). Attenuated and discovery-consistent-minimum effects are lower still.",
    "The pre-2019-12 Binance spot history is not an equivalent surface: fewer than 50 USDT symbols have any monthly file before 2019-07 (raw counts before exclusions and listing age), so at most about two months of an N=50 universe exist.",
    "Spending 2025 and 2026 on a knowingly underpowered confirmation would consume the only protected fresh surface for an uninformative answer. Both stay sealed."
  ],
